					<outline text="Bloggercon report -- I had a fucking great time at Bloggercon this morning. I woke up at 7:00 this morning hung-over as hell from drinking alone in my room. I met a lot of podcasting 'celebrities' including Dave Slusher from Evil Genius Cronicles,..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000113.html"/>
