					<outline text="Rock and Roll Geek Show 11/4/04 Podcast -- Topics: Angry Music for Angry People Rock and Roll News Puking at the Boston concert Music: Patti Smith Group Generation X American Heartbreak Andrew W.K. Click Here for the mp3...." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000111.html"/>
					<outline text="Rock and Roll Geek Show 11/1/04 Podcast -- Topics: Rock and Roll News Great musical discoveries Green Day Record Review Music Store discovery Music: Sweet Ramones Nazareth Flexapleasers Click Here for the mp3...." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000109.html"/>
