					<outline text="Rock and Roll Geek Show 10/27/04 Podcast -- The latest episode is now up! It goes a little long this time, I apologize, but it is a pretty entertaining interview. Click Here for the mp3. Topics: Debating Politics- The dummy vs. the lunatic Music: Neurotic Outsiders Replacements Rose..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000107.html"/>
					<outline text="I Just Finished the Melrose interview -- I just got off of the phone with Melrose Larry Green. I only planned on talking for 15 minutes but we got into an argument about politics and it ended up going for 30. It looks like I'll have to..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000106.html"/>
					<outline text="Stern vs. The FCC Podcast -- Here is the recording of Howard Stern calling into the Ronn Owens Show on KGO AM 810 this morning. I know they are going to make me take it down so grab it while you can. It is pretty entertaining...." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000105.html"/>
					<outline text="Another interview is lined up. -- I am interviewing 'Melrose Larry Green', also of Howard Stern Show fame tomorrow for my show. He has a book out called 'Why the Clintons Belong in Prison'. It could be interesting to have him on and debate politics. I..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000104.html"/>
					<outline text="Sunday Night RnR Geek Show Podcast -- I wasn't planning on doing a podcast tonite but the wife went out with her girlfriends and I didn't feel like staring at the wall so I decided to come on and play a little music. I hope you like..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000103.html"/>
					<outline text="Home photos -- The damn dogs The 'Show' setup..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000102.html"/>
					<outline text="Rock and Roll Geek Show 10/22/04 Podcast -- The newest show is up. Click Here for the mp3. I hope you like it . As always, I really appreciate your feedback. Topics: Being Pussywhipped Pissing at the Joan Jett Show Phoney Phone Call NY Times Adam Curry Bloggercon..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000101.html"/>
					<outline text="Things are Looking Up -- My stupid little podcast is getting more exposure. Last night, I did an interview with the NY Times, Adam Curry mentioned the show again on his Daily Source Code (he even played an American Heartbreak song) and G4 Tech TV's..." type="link" url="http://www.americanheartbreak.com/movabletype/archives/000099.html"/>
