					<outline text="Introduction -- &amp;nbsp;A Byte or 2 of Business News is a PodCast of no more than a minute or two in length that features Business (and sometimes Legal and Financial) news and updates about new iPodder.org podcasts related to these subjects, served in meaty bite size chucks of a minute or two...think of it as a bit of seasoning for your PodCast stack!" type="link" url="http://radio.weblogs.com/0141416/categories/businessNewsRssFeed/"/>
